#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The header shows an overall health rating (Excellent / Good / Fair / Poor) and a MOS score. MOS (Mean Opinion Score) is a 1–5 estimate of call quality derived from latency, jitter and packet loss: 5 is excellent, and anything below 3.5 usually feels uncomfortable."
msgstr "标题显示整体健康评级(优秀/好/公平/差)和MOS分数. MOS(Mean opinions Score)是一个1–5的呼叫质量估计,来源于空闲,紧张和包丢失:5是优异的,3.5以下的任何东西通常都会感到不舒服."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_network_stats.html.heex:52
